  "releaseNotes": "Ab4d.SharpEngine.glTF v4.1.9680\n- Improved glTFImporter to support importing keyframe and skinned animations.\n- When UsePbrMaterial in glTFImporter is false (by default), then the importer does not load and create MetalnessRoughness, NormalMap, AmbientOcclusion and Emissive textures. This improves importing of files with PBR textures.",
